    details: "In OpenCap, negative lumbar extension denotes forward trunk flexion.",
    clinical: "An upright or backwardly extended torso shifts the body's center of mass posterior to the knee center of rotation, lengthening the knee extension moment arm and increasing knee joint impact forces."
